include LICENSE README.md CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md ROADMAP.md zensical.toml
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include examples *.py *.md
prune build
prune dist
prune runs
prune recommendations
prune capability-results
prune src/automo.egg-info
global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude __pycache__
